    "## 5.1.1 CLV-Based Segmentation  <a class=\"anchor\" id=\"Customer Lifetime Value\"></a>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "85575f8b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "Following the income analysis, we segment customers by **Customer Lifetime Value (CLV)**.  \n",
    "We construct **CLV ranges using the distribution’s quartiles**, assigning each customer to a quartile-based band. This approach provides balanced groups and enables like-for-like comparisons across the value spectrum.\n",
    "\n",
    "We then analyze feature distributions within these CLV segments to identify how customer characteristics and behaviors vary with **economic contribution over time**.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 71,
   "id": "3d596ab1",
   "metadata": {},
